            "ccf:citation_overall": "Browne, Kristen, Heidi Schlehlein, Bruce W. Herr II, Ellen Quardokus, Andreas Bueckle, and Katy Börner. 2024. *HuBMAP CCF 3D Reference Object Library*. https://humanatlas.io/3d-reference-library. Accessed on June 15, 2024.",
            "ccf:doi": {
